                  {
                    "value": "That direction is load-bearing. 'Trading Stores' is DISTINCTCOUNT with no measure reference in it. As the OUTER item there would be nothing for the column group to rewrite, and all 14 of its columns would return the same current-period count: silently, with no error. As the INNER item it is substituted into the column item's CALCULATE and shifts correctly.",
